1
00:00:00,068 --> 00:00:01,698
(Leonard:)- Hi.
- Hello.

2
00:00:01,703 --> 00:00:03,533
(Penny:)What are you doing?

3
00:00:03,538 --> 00:00:06,808
(Sheldon:)Oh, Leonard's mad at me,
so I'm making him lemon bars.

4
00:00:06,808 --> 00:00:10,048
(Penny:)Does he even
like lemon bars?

5
00:00:10,045 --> 00:00:12,175
(Sheldon:)Not really.

6
00:00:12,180 --> 00:00:15,450
(Sheldon:)But I'm mad at him, too,
so lemon bars it is.

7
00:00:16,284 --> 00:00:18,154
(Penny:)Something happen
at the meeting?

8
00:00:18,153 --> 00:00:20,483
(Sheldon:)They made me promise
I wouldn't talk.

9
00:00:20,488 --> 00:00:21,598
(Penny:)And you talked?

10
00:00:21,620 --> 00:00:22,820
(Sheldon:)Well, now, see?

11
00:00:22,824 --> 00:00:25,124
(Sheldon:)You knew what was gonna
happen. Why didn't they?

12
00:00:25,126 --> 00:00:27,626
(Sheldon:)Anyway, now we're committed
to completing this project

13
00:00:27,629 --> 00:00:29,599
(Sheldon:)in a ridiculously
short time frame,

14
00:00:29,598 --> 00:00:31,228
(Sheldon:)and everyone's
upset with me.

15
00:00:31,233 --> 00:00:33,203
(Penny:)Well, if it makes you
feel any better,

16
00:00:33,201 --> 00:00:34,631
(Penny:)Bernadette's mad at me, too.

17
00:00:34,636 --> 00:00:36,736
Mm. If it makes you
feel any better,

18
00:00:36,738 --> 00:00:39,668
(Sheldon:)a parasitoid wasp known
as Oobius depressus

19
00:00:39,674 --> 00:00:42,104
(Sheldon:)has been rediscovered
after 101 years

20
00:00:42,110 --> 00:00:44,480
(Sheldon:)of presumed extinction.

21
00:00:45,313 --> 00:00:47,483
(Penny:)Why would that
make me feel better?

22
00:00:47,482 --> 00:00:51,322
(Sheldon:)Why would your Bernadette
thing make me feel better?

23
00:00:51,319 --> 00:00:52,889
(Sheldon:)At least mine
was educational.

24
00:00:52,888 --> 00:00:54,918
(Penny:)Okay. Never mind.

